{"html":"<h1 id=\"heading-0\" data-id=\"heading-0\">安装</h1>\n<p>通过<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/zh-CN/overview\">Claude Code官网</a>提供的命令行安装：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>mac, linux</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\" data-raw=\"curl%20-fsSL%20https%3A%2F%2Fclaude.ai%2Finstall.sh%20%7C%20bash\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\">curl -fsSL https://claude.ai/install.sh | bash</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><ul>\n<li>windows powershell</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-ps\"><code class=\"hljs language-ps\" data-raw=\"irm%20https%3A%2F%2Fclaude.ai%2Finstall.ps1%20%7C%20iex\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">irm</span> https://claude.ai/install.ps1 | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">iex</span></span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>没什么好说的，等他下载完就行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"heading-1\" data-id=\"heading-1\">配置第三方API</h1>\n<p>我用的是<a href=\"https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch\">cc-switch</a>。打开后新建供应商，填写API Key。</p>\n<p><strong>重点：填写请求地址的时候一定不要以斜杠结尾，而且不要携带请求地址中的v1</strong></p>\n<p>比如原链接是：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-plaintext\"><code class=\"hljs language-plaintext\" data-raw=\"https%3A%2F%2Fapi.xxx.com%2Fv1%2F\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\">https://api.xxx.com/v1/</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>就只需要填写</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-plaintext\"><code class=\"hljs language-plaintext\" data-raw=\"https%3A%2F%2Fapi.xxx.com\"><div class=\"code-row\">\n            <span class=\"line-num\" data-num=\"1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"code-content\">https://api.xxx.com</span>\n          </div></code>\n</code></pre><p>模型映射填写你使用的中转站支持的模型名称即可，不一定非要claude，其他的如gpt之类的也行。</p>\n<p>之后就可以进行vide coding了（</p>\n","toc":[{"id":"heading-0","level":1,"text":"安装","listNo":"1"},{"id":"heading-1","level":1,"text":"配置第三方API","listNo":"2"}],"characterCount":533}